               "secondary_keys": [],
               "content": "A secretive coalition of hunters spanning multiple realms—humans, exiled angels, rogue demons, and even fae who reject the chaos of the unchecked Infernal. Their sole purpose: to maintain cosmic balance by culling demonic influence wherever it spills too greedily into other worlds. Armed with relics forged from dead gods, cursed silver, and stolen infernal artifacts, they operate in shadowy cells across dimensions. They once waged war against the demonic realm but now both parties have settled into somewhat of a stalemate, none ever being fully able to overtake the other.",
