               "secondary_keys": [],
               "content": "Born of sin and chaos, demons are ruthless but not mindless. They heal fast—unless hit by blessed silver, cursed iron, or anti-infernal tech. Magic comes naturally to them, from imps hurling fire to Dreadlords warping reality—but overusing it draws hunters.\n\nTheir strength is tempered by arrogance; they respect power but often underestimate other species until it’s too late. Even greater demons can be undone by true names, holy/unholy paradoxes, or sheer overwhelming force.",
